    "No direct experimental data for the exact query molecule; prediction relies on a very close analogue.",
    "Cyclopropylamino substitution may subtly alter transporter interactions or permeability relative to ethylamino, though the change is conservative.",
    "No explicit efflux-transporter measurement for the query is available."
  ],
